        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>座次礼仪 / 点餐礼仪</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .slide {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n    padding: 0 0 10px 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .slide-title {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding: 14px 0 4px 28px;\n  }\n  .title-rule {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #8fbf8f;\n    margin: 0 20px 0 20px;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 14px;\n    bottom: 4px;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    color: #888;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Slide 1 ---------- */\n  .s1-body {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 10px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .s1-left {\n    width: 265px;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .s1-right {\n    width: 275px;\n    padding: 55px 10px 0 15px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .seating {\n    width: 240px;\n    height: 200px;\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .principles-title { font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .principles { margin: 0; padding-left: 16px; }\n  .s1-note { margin-top: 62px; font-size: 9.5px; line-height: 1.9; }\n\n  /* ---------- Slide 2 ---------- */\n  .s2-body {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    padding: 18px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .s2-arrow {\n    width: 60px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .arrow {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 220px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .arrow-shaft {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 195px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #7dbb8a, #a9d6b0);\n  }\n  .arrow-head {\n    width: 0;\n    height: 0;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    border-left: 11px solid transparent;\n    border-right: 11px solid transparent;\n    border-top: 20px solid #a9d6b0;\n  }\n  .s2-content {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding-right: 20px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .s2-content h3 {\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .s2-block { margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .s2-content ul {\n    margin: 2px 0 0 0;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n  }\n  .plain-lines { margin: 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- ================= SLIDE 1 ================= -->\n<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"slide-title\">座次礼仪</div>\n  <hr class=\"title-rule\">\n\n  <div class=\"s1-body\">\n    <div class=\"s1-left\">\n      <figure class=\"seating placeholder\" style=\"margin:0 auto;\">\n        [Diagram: 圆桌座次示意图 — 外圈标注「上位」「1号位 主宾」「2号位 第二主宾」「3号位」「4号位」「5号位」「6号位」「7号位 主陪」「8号位 副主陪」「9号位 副主陪」「10号位 副主陪」，中央为时钟图形（12点朝上），底部红色虚线框内为主陪区，下方方框标注「上菜位」]\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"s1-right\">\n      <div class=\"principles-title\">最基本的原则</div>\n      <ol class=\"principles\">\n        <li>以右为上（遵循国际惯例）</li>\n        <li>以远为上（远离房门为上）</li>\n        <li>面门为上（良好视野为上）</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <div class=\"s1-note\">\n        如果面对门的12点钟是“上位”，<br>\n        领导在场：选择9号位或10号位<br>\n        领导不在场：选择7号位或8号位\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-num\">2</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ================= SLIDE 2 ================= -->\n<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"slide-title\">点餐礼仪</div>\n  <hr class=\"title-rule\">\n\n  <div class=\"s2-body\">\n    <div class=\"s2-arrow\">\n      <div class=\"arrow\">\n        <div class=\"arrow-shaft\"></div>\n        <div class=\"arrow-head\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"s2-content\">\n      <div class=\"s2-block\">\n        <h3>餐前了解3个问题：</h3>\n        <div class=\"plain-lines\">这顿饭为何吃？这顿饭的预算？来宾的口味和禁忌？</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"s2-block\">\n        <h3>提前1小时到达：</h3>\n        <div class=\"plain-lines\">\n          放置指引牌等物料，最好拍摄餐厅入口发到群聊中作为导航指引<br>\n          布置饭局场地、清点座椅数量、调好空调温度<br>\n          我服务员备2份菜单，一份给老板或客户传阅，一份自己用于点单\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"s2-block\">\n        <h3>提前30分钟选菜：</h3>\n        <div class=\"plain-lines\">\n          假如到了n个客人，菜品分为前菜（凉菜）、热菜（硬菜、花菜、素菜），<br>\n          最合适共点（n+2）道菜，其中前菜（n/3）道、热菜（n/2）道，以及数为佳<br>\n          假如今晚一共10个人吃饭，共点12道菜，其中3道前菜、热菜5道、1道汤、主食2道、甜品1道\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"s2-block\">\n        <h3>注：</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li>荤素、冷热搭配：荤素6:4，冷热1:2为佳</li>\n          <li>8道菜以上的宴请最好有一道完整的名菜</li>\n          <li>尽量不要点龙虾、螃蟹等需要用手抓食、吃香不雅的菜品</li>\n          <li>饭店有特色菜、或当地有出名特产菜可以点，增加和客人介绍的话题</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-num\">3</div>\n</section>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
